      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place tart shells on a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash blackberries and lemon zest together in a small bowl until just combined: spoon into tart shells.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk brown sugar, honey, egg, melted butter, vanilla, and salt together in a separate bowl: spoon over blackberries.",
      "section": null,
